[[0,1416402,0,3,1,2,"2016-11-17T01:07:20","Ozzsanity","",[],"","Trump supporters call to boycott Pepsi over comments the CEO never made","http://money.cnn.com/2016/11/16/news/companies/pepsi-fake-news-boycott-trump/index.html?iid=hp-stack-dom","news"],[1,6842772,0,2,5,-3,"2016-11-17T01:08:22","Ozzsanity","",[],"<p>Trump supporters are easily fooled.</p>"],[2,6843240,6842772,1,0,1,"2016-11-17T02:02:37","KosherHiveKicker","[e]",[],"<p>How much money did Hillary's 2016 campaign waste attempting to gain the vote of &quot;easily fooled&quot; Trump supporters?</p>"],[3,6844177,6843240,1,0,1,"2016-11-17T04:10:59","Rebel_Media_FTW","",[],"<p>Hillary: $1.3 Billion</p>\n<p>Trump: $250 Million</p>"],[1,6842789,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T01:10:06","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/7wNTq\">https://archive.is/7wNTq</a> : \n</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Trump supporters call to boycott Pepsi over comments the CEO never made - Nov. 16, 2016 </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/GU8hr1.gif\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6842888,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-17T01:22:33","nomenimion","",[],"<p>Meh. Coke is better, anyway.</p>"],[1,6842950,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T01:29:21","brandon816","",[],"<p>Looks like one or two news sources misquoted it somewhere (intentionally or not), and everyone else in a rush to get to the news first copied and pasted it. Forbes openly admits that it's been corrected on their version of the article. Once it made the leap to twitter, it didn't matter that it was corrected.</p>\n<p>I don't particularly like that she made her response political, specifically the focus on the &quot;locker room&quot; talk sound bites (even as she lamented that they have risen in importance). But, the quote being passed around on Twitter doesn't seem to come from an online source. I can't find it anywhere, even alt-right news sources.</p>\n<p>The way I figure, someone must've said it, and a second person added quotes to say that someone else said it, and a third person misinterpreted that to say that the CEO was the one who said it.</p>"]]
