[[0,1416417,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-17T01:16:53","DrudgeBot","",[],"","NSA SECRET SPY SKYSCRAPER; COVERT MONITORING HUBAT&T COVER","https://theintercept.com/2016/11/16/the-nsas-spy-hub-in-new-york-hidden-in-plain-sight/","Drudge"],[1,6842873,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T01:20:44","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/6t8SJ\">https://archive.is/6t8SJ</a> : \n</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The NSA’s Spy Hub in New York, Hidden in Plain Sight </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>'When presented with the details linking 33 Thomas Street to NSA’s TITANPOINTE, Klein added: “I’m not surprised. ' </p>\n<p>'Unlike the many neighboring residential and office buildings, it is impossible to get a glimpse inside 33 Thomas Street. ' </p>\n<p>'The 33 Thomas Street building is located almost next door to the FBI’s New York field office — about a block away — at Federal Plaza. ' </p>\n<p>'That is a particularly striking detail, because on the roof of 33 Thomas Street there are a number of satellite dishes. ' </p>\n<p>'For many New Yorkers, 33 Thomas Street — known as the “Long Lines Building” — has been a source of mystery for years. ' </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/aRgGC5.gif\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"]]
