[[0,1416419,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-17T01:16:56","DrudgeBot","",[],"","How DRUDGE Won Election...","http://www.vocativ.com/376550/drudge-won-2016-election/","Drudge"],[1,6842869,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T01:20:05","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/Yfy7I\">https://archive.is/Yfy7I</a> : \n</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>$HRILLARY: How Matt Drudge Won The 2016 Election - Vocativ </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>'From July 1 to November 2, Vocativ collected data from the Drudge Report’s archive related to the 2016 election. ' </p>\n<p>'And below that, three issues — “Hillary’s health,” “Clinton Foundation,” and “DNC” — all hovered around the 4.5 percent mark. ' </p>\n<p>'In an election cycle when just about everyone got it wrong, Matt Drudge ended up vindicated. ' </p>\n<p>'Yet, many credit Drudge with making Clinton’s health an issue on the far right. ' </p>\n<p>'But this year, Drudge had an almost singular focus: eviscerating Hillary Clinton. ' </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/IJpuZ4.png\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"]]
